[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    44[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    in memory order (little-endian on this target: LSB first).
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    45[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 4. **Call multiplicity / interleaving** on the shared process-wide `stdout` FILE
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    46[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    stream — the only global state the library touches (empty / one / many calls,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    47[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    and calls interleaved between the C `.so` and the Rust `.so`).
