[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    249[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    250[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // Row 14 — call multiplicity on the shared stdout stream. Output for N calls
