[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    252[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // captured in isolation must produce exactly its own 9 bytes.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    253[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    254[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
